                        {
                            "speaker": {
                                "name": "Michael Cera",
                                "sprite": "michael_cera_neutral"
                            },
                            "text": "He was the beating heart of the original Superbad. There is simply no Superbad 2 without Jonah Hill."
                        },
                        {
                            "speaker": {
                                "name": "Michael Cera",
                                "sprite": "michael_cera_neutral"
                            },
                            "text": "Obviously I'm referring to the Jonah Hill we all used to love, not... \"Jonah Hill.\""
